---
title: 複数日に渡る処刑が霊能者の mediumHistory に day key で個別に記録される
setup: { medium: 1, werewolf: 2, villager: 2 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# Day 1 で Bob (狼1) 処刑 → mediumHistory[1] = { Bob, wolf }
# Night 1 で残狼 Carol が Dave 襲撃 (Alice 生存維持のため Dave を犠牲)
# Day 2 で Carol (狼2) 処刑 → mediumHistory[2] = { Carol, wolf } → 狼全滅で終局

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=霊能者
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Carol 1夜 襲撃 Dave

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Carol→Eve
Dave→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Bob 3 / Alice 1 / Eve 1 → execution=Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# night_kill: Dave
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Carol
Eve→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Carol 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: villager_won
# survivors: Alice, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-medium actor:Alice day:1 target:Bob result:wolf
# @expect-medium actor:Alice day:2 target:Carol result:wolf
